WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.470
Picture a desert.

2
00:00:01.520 --> 00:00:06.610
Hot sand, a blazing sun,
hardly a plant in sight.

3
00:00:06.660 --> 00:00:08.550
Now picture Antarctica,

4
00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:11.970
the cold continent at the
bottom of the world map.

5
00:00:12.020 --> 00:00:14.910
Could a place that
cold be a desert too?

6
00:00:14.960 --> 00:00:18.110
In this mission, you'll place
the seven continents and five

7
00:00:18.160 --> 00:00:19.530
oceans on a map.

8
00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:22.780
You'll find out how a continent
is different from a country.

9
00:00:22.830 --> 00:00:25.830
You'll locate some of the
world's most important places,

10
00:00:25.880 --> 00:00:28.630
along with mountains,
rivers and deserts.

11
00:00:28.680 --> 00:00:32.510
And you'll learn a simple test
that tells physical features

12
00:00:32.560 --> 00:00:34.390
from human ones.

13
00:00:34.440 --> 00:00:38.150
Your mission: decide whether
Antarctica belongs on the list of

14
00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.850
the world's deserts.
